      "content": "That painful feeling of being an invisible observer is often a sign that you're carrying a heavy burden, but remember you are absolutely real. Your presence and pain have an impact on the people you are hiding from, even if they can't see it. Please consider reaching out to someone you trust or a professional counselor so you don't have to walk through your world feeling like a ghost.",
