    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just something people say to feel better, isn't it? it feels less like a \"burden\" and more like a mathematical fact. i look at the scale of this place, the millions of lights and people, and i just realize i'm a rounding error. there's no real weight to me. if i wasn't here, the math wouldn't even change.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
